OperationMapping=Dolibarr mapping
OperationMapping_standard=Standard invoice
OperationMapping_deposit=Deposit invoice
OperationMapping_credit_note=Credit note linked to original invoice
OperationMapping_standard_adjustment=Standard adjustment linked to original invoice
SourceDolibarrInvoice=Source Dolibarr invoice
ImportNonCreateDraftNotice=This NAV modification/storno is imported as a separate Dolibarr document linked to the original invoice. For fully READY inbound cases, automatic validation may run according to the module setting. The NAV operation chain remains authoritative; no existing Dolibarr invoice is overwritten.
ImportBlocker_advance_invoice_mapping_pending=NAV line data identifies this as a deposit/advance invoice. Its NAV invoice category may still be NORMAL; Dolibarr deposit-invoice mapping is not enabled yet, so it will not be imported as a standard Dolibarr invoice.
ImportBlocker_operation_operation_unsupported=This NAV operation has no supported Dolibarr mapping.
ImportBlocker_operation_relation_original_invoice_number_missing=The modifying/storno invoice does not identify the original invoice.
ImportBlocker_operation_relation_original_mirror_missing=The original NAV invoice is missing from the local mirror.
ImportBlocker_operation_relation_modify_without_master_policy_required=NAV permits this modification without an available master invoice, but there is no safe Dolibarr import policy for that case yet.
ImportBlocker_operation_relation_original_not_imported=The original NAV invoice is not linked to a Dolibarr invoice yet. Import or resolve the original invoice first.
ImportBlocker_operation_relation_modification_index_ambiguous=More than one local chain member uses the same modification index.
ImportBlocker_operation_relation_prior_modification_not_imported=An earlier NAV modification in this chain has not been imported yet. Modifications must be imported in sequence.
ImportBlocker_operation_authoritative_chain_mismatch=The local NAV mirror does not match the authoritative invoice chain returned by queryInvoiceChainDigest. Synchronize/review the chain before import.
ImportBlocker_operation_current_chain_member_missing=The current invoice was not found in NAV's authoritative invoice chain.
ImportBlocker_operation_current_chain_operation_mismatch=The current invoice operation differs from NAV's authoritative chain data.
ImportBlocker_operation_authoritative_chain_unavailable=The authoritative NAV invoice chain could not be queried, so a modification/storno cannot be imported safely.
ImportBlocker_operation_operation_total_missing=The financial effect of the NAV operation cannot be determined from the invoice totals.
ImportBlocker_operation_storno_not_negative=A STORNO must have a negative financial effect before it can be mapped to a Dolibarr credit note.
ImportBlocker_operation_non_financial_modification=This MODIFY has no financial effect. Creating a financial Dolibarr invoice would misrepresent the correction, so it remains review-only for now.
ImportBlocker_operation_credit_note_net_positive=The operation would map to a credit note, but its net amount is positive. Dolibarr requires a credit note to have a non-positive net total.
ImportBlocker_operation_standard_adjustment_negative_lines_disabled=This positive MODIFY contains both positive and negative lines, but Dolibarr is configured to reject negative lines on standard invoices.
ImportBlocker_operation_source_invoice_missing=The original Dolibarr invoice required as the source relationship is missing.
ImportBlocker_operation_source_partner_mismatch=The resolved source invoice belongs to a different Dolibarr third party than the current NAV invoice.
ImportWarning_operation_relation_modification_index_missing=The NAV relation has no positive modification index; review the sequence before import.
ImportWarning_operation_relation_original_mirror_missing_allowed=NAV marks this as modifyWithoutMaster; the original invoice is not available in the local mirror.
ImportWarning_operation_mixed_sign_modification=The modification contains both positive and negative line effects. Review the resulting document carefully.
